      "explain": {
        "text": "The pattern $u_1 = a$, $u_2 = a + d$, $u_3 = a + 2d$ adds one $d$ per gap. Position $n$ has $n - 1$ gaps before it, so $u_n = a + (n - 1)d$. For $4, 7, 10, \\dots$ that is $4 + 3(n - 1) = 3n + 1$."
      }
